<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('../partials/head') %></head>
<body class="flex overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950" style="height:100vh;font-family:'Sofia Sans',sans-serif">

  <%- include('../partials/adminSidebar', { currentPage: 'moderation' }) %>

  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">

    <main class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8 flex items-start justify-center">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-white/8 rounded-md p-12 max-w-md w-full text-center mt-8">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <iconify-icon icon="lucide:flag" width="24" style="color:#f87171;display:block"></iconify-icon>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-bold bg-white/8 text-zinc-500 mb-4">Phase 6</span>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-0 mb-2">Moderation Queue</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">All comments reported by users appear here for review. Each report shows the comment in context, the reporter, and the date.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-zinc-400 text-left flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Comment shown in context (entry + thread)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Who reported it and when</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Dismiss → closes the report, comment stays</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><iconify-icon icon="lucide:circle-dot" width="13" style="color:#52525b;display:block"></iconify-icon>Remove → deletes the comment from the platform</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </main>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
